      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think this issue is pretty important, considering that `Lock Hips` is the **default** FBT Spine Mode setting.\n\nEither change the default setting to `Head` and show a warning about the HeadChop when using `Hips` Lock Mode,\n\nOR... Kung could exclude the HeadChop from being drifted with the Hips entirely, and have the HeadChop always Lock to the Head on the Local Side regardless of FBT Spine Mode. This solution would eliminate the need for Constraints with any Spine Mode.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
