      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This would result in the visual position of your own head chopped bones deviating from what everyone remote would be seeing.\n\nMaybe this would make for a good setting in the component. A toggle to make it so that the VRC head chop also re-parents the referenced bone transforms to the first person camera. Is this even possible though if the related transforms are part of an armature?",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
