      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is kind of how it suppose to works and one of reasons why head chop exists for a long time already. Using lock to hips will cause for almost every avatar to have very incorrect position of head bone relative to real head. I don't think it's possible to fix this other way then just disabling HeadChop components when Lock Hips is used and that could lead to more confusion if it's not communicated properly.\n\nAnyway I think that Lock Head should be default option because position of head is way more important then hips and locking both doesn't always works.\n\nBtw this should be observable even with the constrain workaround that is commonly used.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
