  "details": "1. Use an Avatar with the VRCHeadChop Component.\n\n2. Try using `Lock Hips` as your `FBT Spine Mode` setting, found under Tracking & IK Settings.\n\n3. You will see that your HeadChopped Bones will drift with the Hips.\n\nExpected Behavior: The HeadChop should NEVER drift with your Hips when using `Lock Hips` as the FBT Spine Mode.\n\nUsed SDK 3.5.2-beta.2.\n\nVideo Example of the issue here: https://youtu.be/vOgt_UiLlUs",
